  "problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14131901/assets/37b7c322e3b10c43c384d988e4e638f7c48af13510e1e93852bd30ad951300d7.png)\n\nWhat type of angle is $∠VOW,$ shown in the figure above?",
  "worked_solution": "Notice that the vertex of $∠VOW$ is point $O,$ not point $W.$ So $∠VOW$ is *not* a straight angle.\n\nWe can think of $∠VOW$ as:\n\n- a *null* angle, if we assume that it doesn't turn at all (diagram on the left), or\n\n- a *full* angle, if we assume that it makes one full turn (diagram on the right).\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14131901/assets/a6415202fbd2a0d28de83c493294f40098a0e4cc39133ddef8033fd639cd47fb.png)\n\nSo, the answer is 'Null' or 'Full'.",
